        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo LP-207, Outswing Door Steel Security Latch Guard Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis heavy duty steel security door latch protector is 7\" high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building). For use with key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nProtect your entry doors from tampering and latch prying with this  security latch protector plate. No special tools required for installation. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available:  <a href=\"/products/7-inch-stainless-security-latch-guard-plate-don-jo-lp-107-630\"><b>7\" Stainless Steel Door Latch Guard</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n Packaged with carriage bolts, washers and acorn nuts for safety and strength. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-LP-207_size.gif?v=1704354658\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo LP-207 Security Latch Guard size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNon-Handed, reversible for left or right hand outswinging doors. Fits doors with standard 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo LP-207 Security Latch Guard:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 12 Gauge (.104\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel </li>\r\n<li>Offset: 1/4\" (.250\") </li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed (reversible)</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 2 each 5/16-18 x 2-1/4\" Carriage bolt with Acorn nuts and washers.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LP-207.pdf?v=1704262233\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo LP-207 Security Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "7 Inch Security Latch Guard Plate, Don-Jo LP-207",
                "description": "Don-Jo  LP-207 steel latch guard. This steel security door latch protector is 7 inch high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building). For use with key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock) . Available in 4 different finish colors.",
                "keywords": "DJO-LP-207 Steel Door Latch Security Guard, DJO-LP-207 7 inch latch protectors, Outswing Door Security Plates, front Door Security Latch Guard, Don-Jo LP-207 latch protectors, Don-Jo LP-207 door security plates, don-joe front Door Latch Guards, anti vandal plates, door Security plates, commercial Steel Door Latch Guard Plates, Don-Jo LP-207 steel latch guards, 7 Inch Steel Security Guard Plates, Don-Jo LP-207-SL, Don-Jo LP-207-DU, Don-Jo LP-207-CP, Don-Jo LP-207-BP,"
